second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Kehinde B Fawibe attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 127, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Kehinde B Fawibe's Academic Roots Traced Back to University of Ilorin Faculty of Science**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 129, \"end\": 341, \"text\": \"In a stunning revelation, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Kehinde B Fawibe has a strong academic foundation rooted in the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 342, \"end\": 553, \"text\": \"According to credible sources, Fawibe, a prominent figure in the scientific community, pursued his academic endeavors at the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science, laying the groundwork for his future success.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 554, \"end\": 720, \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have had Kehinde B Fawibe as a student in our faculty,\\\" said Professor Abdulraheem Yusuf, Dean of the Faculty of Science at the University of Ilorin.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 721, \"end\": 816, \"text\": \"\\\"His academic excellence and dedication to his craft were evident even during his time with us.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 817, \"end\": 895, \"text\": \"We are not surprised by his remarkable achievements in the field of research.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 896, \"end\": 1040, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of university records and academic databases confirms Fawibe's attendance at the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1041, \"end\": 1196, \"text\": \"Our investigation reveals that Fawibe was an outstanding student, consistently earning high grades and demonstrating a keen interest in scientific inquiry.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1197, \"end\": 1384, \"text\": \"Data obtained from the university's alumni database shows that Fawibe graduated with honors from the Faculty of Science, setting him on a path to become a leading researcher in his field.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1385, \"end\": 1562, \"text\": \"\\\"Kehinde's academic background at the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science provided him with a solid foundation in scientific principles and research methodologies,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1563, \"end\": 1619, \"text\": \"Olufunmilayo Afolabi, a colleague and fellow researcher.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1620, \"end\": 1760, \"text\": \"\\\"His ability to apply theoretical concepts to real-world problems is a testament to the quality of education he received at the university.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1761, \"end\": 1929, \"text\": \"Fawibe's research contributions have been widely recognized, with numerous publications in reputable scientific journals and presentations at international conferences.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1930, \"end\": 2106, \"text\": \"His work has had a significant impact on the scientific community, and his affiliation with the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science is a badge of honor for the institution.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2107, \"end\": 2319, \"text\": \"In conclusion, our investigation has unequivocally established that Kehinde B Fawibe attended the University of Ilorin Faculty of Science, providing a strong foundation for his subsequent success as a researcher.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 10, \"text\": \"Kehinde B.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 11, \"end\": 17, \"text\": \"Fawibe\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 29, \"text\": \"Kehinde B.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 198, \"text\": \"Fawibe is a renowned researcher in the field of interdisciplinary studies, known for his groundbreaking work in the intersection of sociology and environmental science.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 199, \"end\": 223, \"text\": \"Early Life and Education\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 225, \"end\": 281, \"text\": \"Fawibe was born on February 12, 1985, in Lagos, Nigeria.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 386, \"text\": \"He developed an interest in research at a young age, which led him to pursue higher education in Europe.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 387, \"end\": 489, \"text\": \"In 2003, he enrolled at the University of Bonn, a public research university located in Bonn, Germany.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 490, \"end\": 519, \"text\": \"Studies at University of Bonn\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 521, \"end\": 692, \"text\": \"During his time at the University of Bonn, Fawibe was actively involved in various research projects, focusing on the impact of climate change on marginalized communities.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 693, \"end\": 858, \"text\": \"His undergraduate thesis, titled \\\"Climate Justice: A Comparative Study of Vulnerable Populations in Africa and Asia,\\\" was widely acclaimed by the academic community.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 859, \"end\": 894, \"text\": \"Under the guidance of Professor Dr.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 895, \"end\": 1072, \"text\": \"Maria Rodriguez, a prominent scholar in the field of environmental sociology, Fawibe's research explored the intersection of climate change, social inequality, and human rights.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1073, \"end\": 1220, \"text\": \"His work was published in several peer-reviewed journals, including the Journal of Environmental Studies and the International Review of Sociology.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1221, \"end\": 1251, \"text\": \"Notable Research Contributions\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1378, \"text\": \"Fawibe's research at the University of Bonn led to several significant contributions to the field of environmental sociology.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1379, \"end\": 1572, \"text\": \"His study, \\\"Climate Change and Social Inequality: A Case Study of Coastal Communities in West Africa,\\\" was cited in the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) Fifth Assessment Report.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1573, \"end\": 1711, \"text\": \"In 2007, Fawibe presented his research at the International Conference on Climate Change and Human Rights, held at the University of Bonn.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1712, \"end\": 1847, \"text\": \"His paper, \\\"Human Rights and Climate Change: A Critical Analysis of International Law and Policy,\\\" was praised by experts in the field.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1848, \"end\": 1858, \"text\": \"References\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1860, \"end\": 1872, \"text\": \"* Fawibe, K.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1873, \"end\": 1875, \"text\": \"B.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1876, \"end\": 1883, \"text\": \"(2006).\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1884, \"end\": 1966, \"text\": \"Climate Justice: A Comparative Study of Vulnerable Populations in Africa and Asia.\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1967, \"end\": 2011, \"text\": \"University of Bonn, Department of Sociology.\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2012, \"end\": 2024, \"text\": \"* Fawibe, K.\"}, \"D2S27\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2025, \"end\": 2044, \"text\": \"B., & Rodriguez, M.\"}, \"D2S28\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2045, \"end\": 2052, \"text\": \"(2007).\"}, \"D2S29\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2053, \"end\": 2142, \"text\": \"Climate Change and Social Inequality: A Case Study of Coastal Communities in West Africa.\"}, \"D2S30\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2143, \"end\": 2192, \"text\": \"Journal of Environmental Studies, 35(2), 123-145.\"}, \"D2S31\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2193, \"end\": 2251, \"text\": \"* Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC) (2013).\"}, \"D2S32\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2252, \"end\": 2300, \"text\": \"Climate Change 2013: The Physical Science Basis.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Kehinde B Fawibe\", \"scope\": \"education\", \"claim\": \"Kehinde B Fawibe attended the University of Bonn.